#: blocks/recent-jobs/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Static sidebar widget listing the most recently published jobs."
msgstr "Statische zijbalkwidget met de meest recent gepubliceerde vacatures."

#: blocks/similar-companies-card/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Sidebar card listing companies in the same industry. Auto-resolves on company-single pages or set Company ID manually."
